                                                "sense_id": "79ea5841-bbd3-3951-925c-3aef0fae41b8",
                                                "text": "Before the grave was half filled a truck entered the cemetery gates towing a lowboy with a tractor chained to the bed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
